557-4887-a6cf-0bd99b630704","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"フロントでモック作るって話だったんでサーバの挙動を確認する話じゃないと思ってたんですよね\nサーバの挙動を確認するならサーバサイドでテストを用意して解決するか、フロントから叩くならモックを用意するとそもそもサーバサイドの挙動のテストにならないので","ts":"1633160769.385900","thread_ts":"1633160769.385900","edited":{"user":"U8996GYBF","ts":"1633160815.000000"},"reply_count":18,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"szY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5d681c2-dae0-47aa-8508-fe17eb5e6e72","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ~それでいうと自分は、jest(恐らくホワイトボックステスト用)でブラックボックステストをしようとしていたのか","ts":"1633160715.384700","thread_ts":"1633155556.317000","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ng8"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"c2beaf2f-a9cf-458e-bdd6-90066736352c","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"ホワイトボックスかブラックボックスか","ts":"1633155556.317000","thread_ts":"1633155556.317000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PQdv="}]}},{"client_msg_id":"33efdf2c-6892-4a01-9bf0-c044e8755d08","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"私がこれから学ぶべきは\n• テスト観点の整理方法\n• 各テスト(E2Eテスト、ユニットテスト…)などの違いと特徴\nといったところか","ts":"1633160629.383600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2CmE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19f3c624-16fe-48a3-b26d-27052799647c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"フロントからそれを一通で確認するならテストに使うためのアプリケーションサーバを実際に用意しないといけない気がする","ts":"1633160567.383300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VE/N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ba6dbf3-0b99-4e4d-9975-131e8137ab7e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"E2Eというかなんらかの結合テストか","ts":"1633160473.382400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7/x3"}]},{"client_